                "text_JH88HT": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Founded by a passionate Canadian family deeply rooted in martial arts, Antares Athletics dedicates itself to providing top-quality gear. We equip athletes for BJJ and all combat sports. Our mission remains simple: offer the essential tools athletes need to pursue their ambitions and excel in their craft. We focus intensely on durability, performance, and distinctive style, supplying everything from robust gis to resilient rashguards. Every product we offer is designed with the athlete's specific needs firmly in mind. Our name, Antares, powerfully symbolizes the strength and perseverance every true martial artist embodies. As a proud family-run company, we prioritize community, build trust, and offer unwavering support for athletes at every level. We invite you to <strong>Wear Your Ambitions with Antares Athletics.</strong><br/><br/></p>",
                    "width": "fit-content",
                    "max_width": "none",
                    "alignment": "left",
